# Yarn Basket

> Crochet flower bouquets, keychains, flower pots, bag charms and hair accessories, made by hand by Priya in Piro, Bihar, India. Sold online and delivered across India.

## Who is Yarn Basket?

Yarn Basket is a small crochet studio in Piro, Bihar. Everything you see here is made at home by Priya, one stitch at a time.

- Made by: Priya Singh
- Where: Piro, Bihar, India
- Since: 2025
- What we make: Crochet flower bouquets, keychains, flower pots, bag charms and hair accessories
- How: By hand, one piece at a time. No machines.
- Yarn: Soft acrylic yarn, crocheted by hand.

Read more: [Our story]({{ agents.store_url }}/pages/our-story)

