Full details: [Shipping policy]({{ agents.store_url }}/policies/shipping-policy)

## Can a Yarn Basket order be returned?

Every Yarn Basket piece is crocheted by hand, so we do not take returns for a change of mind. If something arrives damaged, wrong or missing, we put it right with a replacement or a full refund.

- **Damaged, wrong or missing:** tell us within 48 hours of delivery, with an unboxing video or clear photos. We send a replacement or refund you in full.
- **Change of mind:** no returns or exchanges.
- **Cancelling:** free at any time before your order is dispatched.
- **Refunds:** paid within 5 to 7 working days.

Full details: [Refund policy]({{ agents.store_url }}/policies/refund-policy)

## Does Yarn Basket take custom and bulk orders?

Yes. Want a crochet bouquet in your own colours, or the same keychain for every guest? Everything at Yarn Basket is made by hand, one piece at a time, so we can make yours the way you want it.

- **Your colours:** A bouquet, a keychain or a hair piece from the shop, in the colours you choose.
- **A custom crochet bouquet:** Your own mix of flowers, or a bigger bouquet than the ones we show.
- **Names and initials:** A name or initials worked into the gift. Ask us which pieces it suits.
- **Bulk orders and return gifts:** Many of one piece for a wedding, a birthday party, a baby shower, a class or an office.

How it works:

1. **Tell us what you have in mind.** Message us on WhatsApp or write to us: the piece, the colours, how many, and the date you need them by. A photo helps.
2. **We agree the details with you.** Priya tells you what she can make, what it will cost and how long it will take. Nothing starts until you are happy with all three.
3. **Made by hand, then sent.** Once the order is paid for, Priya crochets it by hand and we send it by courier with tracking, anywhere in India.

Ask here: [Custom and bulk orders]({{ agents.store_url }}/pages/custom-orders)

## Collections

### By craft

- [Crochet Bouquets]({{ agents.store_url }}/collections/bouquets): Crochet flower bouquets, made by hand in India. Sunflowers, roses, tulips and daisies are crocheted stem by stem, then wrapped in black and gold and tied with a ribbon, ready to give.
- [Crochet Keychains]({{ agents.store_url }}/collections/keychains): Crochet keychains, made by hand in India: sunflowers, daisies, an evil eye, a peacock feather, a bee, a chick and a baby octopus. Each one is crocheted from soft yarn and comes on a metal ring and chain, for keys, a bag or a zip.
- [Crochet Hair Accessories]({{ agents.store_url }}/collections/hair-accessories): Crochet hair accessories, made by hand in India: hair clips topped with flowers, tie-on headbands, claw clips, little heart hair pins and soft scrunchies. They are light enough to wear all day, and they suit girls and women alike.
- [Crochet Bag Charms]({{ agents.store_url }}/collections/bag-charms): Crochet bag charms, made by hand in India. Our lily of the valley charm is two little bell flowers hanging from a green bow, crocheted from soft yarn in pink or white.
- [Crochet Flower Pots]({{ agents.store_url }}/collections/flower-pots): Crochet flower pots, made by hand in India. A sunflower or a daisy grows in its own little pot, and all of it is crochet: the petals, the leaves, the soil and the pot.
- [Crochet Home Decor]({{ agents.store_url }}/collections/home-decor): Crochet home decor, made by hand in India. There are flower pots for desks, shelves and windowsills, and sunflower tie-backs that hold a curtain open.

### Shop by flower

- [Crochet Flowers]({{ agents.store_url }}/collections/crochet-flowers): Crochet flowers, made by hand in India, that never wilt and need no water. Choose by flower: sunflowers, roses, tulips and daisies.
- [Crochet Sunflowers]({{ agents.store_url }}/collections/sunflowers): Crochet sunflowers, made by hand in India. The sunflower is the flower we make most, so it is on almost everything: bouquets, flower pots, keychains, hair clips, headbands and curtain tie-backs.
- [Crochet Roses]({{ agents.store_url }}/collections/roses): Crochet roses, made by hand in India. Each rose is crocheted from soft yarn and shaped into a full bloom, in red, pink or yellow.
- [Crochet Tulips]({{ agents.store_url }}/collections/tulips): Crochet tulips, made by hand in India. Each tulip is crocheted from soft yarn with a long curved leaf, in pink, blue, lavender or white.
- [Crochet Daisies]({{ agents.store_url }}/collections/daisies): Crochet daisies, made by hand in India. White petals around a yellow centre, or a soft blue daisy, crocheted from yarn one petal at a time.
- [Evil Eye Crochet Keychains]({{ agents.store_url }}/collections/evil-eye): Evil eye crochet keychains, made by hand in India. The nazar charm in rings of deep blue, white and sky blue, on a metal ring and chain for car keys, bike keys or a bag.

